yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Java outputs
**/target/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
*.class
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Python outputs and local environments
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytype/
**/.tox/
**/.nox/
